# After collapsing everything, = expands one level at a time and - collapses the deepest level first.
file <<END
Work:
	Launch:
		- Draft announcement
		- Book venue
Home
END
keys _ =
see Launch: ▸ 2
hide Draft announcement
keys =
see - Draft announcement
keys -
see Launch: ▸ 2
keys -
see Work: ▸ 2
hide Launch
quit
